  "entries": [
    {
      "text": "Thank you for calling VeloFit. Your call is important to us. Please hold while we connect you to the next available agent.",
      "speakerId": "AUTOMATED_AGENT",
      "role": "AUTOMATED_AGENT",
      "user_id": 0,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1765409473000000
    },
    {
      "text": "Thank you for holding. My name is Sarah. How can I help you today?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 303,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1765409481333333
    },
    {
      "text": "Look, I'm short on time. I need to return a helmet. Just tell me yes or no, can I do it?",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 59861,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1765409485933333
    },
    {
      "text": "I can certainly look into that for you. Do you have the order number handy?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 303,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1765409491999999
    },
    {
      "text": "Yes, it's VF8675309. Just look it up.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 59861,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1765409497199999
    },
    {
      "text": "Okay, one moment... VF8675309. I see the order. It was delivered 73 days ago. Before we proceed, can I just ask, what specifically is the issue with the helmet? Is it a technical fault or a preference?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 303,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1765409499866665
    },
    {
      "text": "It's the wrong color. My wife bought it as a gift, and the box is still unopened. The factory seal is intact, so there's no safety issue. Can you process the return or not?",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 59861,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1765409513466665
    },
    {
      "text": "Yes, I can. According to our policy, you're well within the 90-day return window. I can process that for you right now.",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 303,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1765409525133331
    },
    {
      "text": "Great. Finally. What's next?",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 59861,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1765409533266664
    },
    {
      "text": "I've just initiated the return. You'll receive an email with a pre-paid shipping label in the next few minutes. Also, I see you're a VIP member with VeloFit. As a thank you for your loyalty, I've added a 20% discount code to your account for your next purchase.",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 303,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1765409535333330
    },
    {
      "text": "Oh. Okay, that's good. Thank you.",
